               <col width="4%"/>
               <col width="92%"/>
               <tbody>
                  <tr>
                     <td valign="top"  />
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <p class="oj-normal">32.</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <span>[Voluntary for undertakings with 10 employees or less] The undertaking shall disclose its total energy consumption in MWh. If it can obtain the necessary information to provide such a breakdown, the undertaking shall also disclose a breakdown as per the table below:</span>
