                     </td>
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <span>This module provides disclosures to address in a comprehensive way the information needs of the undertaking’s business partners, such as investors, banks and corporate clients in addition to the ones included in the Basic Module. The disclosures in this module reflect financial market participants and corporate clients’ respective obligations under relevant laws and regulations. They also reflect the information needed by the business partners to assess the sustainability risk profile of the undertaking, e.g. as a (potential) supplier or a (potential) borrower.</span>
                     </td>
