            <p class="oj-ti-grseq-1" id="d1e1334-4-1">C1 –   <span class="oj-expanded">Strategy: Business Model and Sustainability – Related Initiatives</span>
            </p>
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
