               <col width="4%"/>
               <col width="92%"/>
               <tbody>
                  <tr>
                     <td valign="top"  />
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <p class="oj-normal">46.</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <span>The undertaking shall disclose the key elements of its business model and strategy, including:</span>
                        <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                           <col width="4%"/>
                           <col width="96%"/>
