                  >(<span class="oj-super">8</span>)</a>  Directive (EU) 2023/970 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 10 May 2023 to strengthen the application of the principle of equal pay for equal work or work of equal value between men and women through pay transparency and enforcement mechanisms (<a href="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/oj/JOL_2023_132_R_TOC"
